{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 5291332,
  "courseSlug": "chatgpt-bard-bing-complete-guide-to-chatgpt-openai-apis",
  "courseTitle": "ChatGPT & Generative AI - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37885380",
      "title": "Understanding Parameters",
      "sourceHash": "cbed8c04dd9d2b55d0fed60d31e94f7b19650700c7c9ab682165d5861e45177f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 3.39,
          "en": "We learned how to change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.39,
          "end": 6.24,
          "en": "the content of the created image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.24,
          "end": 8.67,
          "en": "Now we'll also learn how we can change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.67,
          "end": 11.28,
          "en": "the way the image is created in general",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.28,
          "end": 14.01,
          "en": "by adding so-called parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.01,
          "end": 16.38,
          "en": "Up to this point, prompts looked like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.38,
          "end": 19.11,
          "en": "So we had our prompt where we defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.11,
          "end": 23.94,
          "en": "the content of the image with the so-called text prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.94,
          "end": 26.01,
          "en": "But now, after this text prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.01,
          "end": 29.373,
          "en": "we can add additional information like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.8,
          "end": 33.63,
          "en": "These additional prompts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.63,
          "end": 36.27,
          "en": "so to say, are called parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.27,
          "end": 39.51,
          "en": "A parameter always consists of the definition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.51,
          "end": 42.87,
          "en": "of the parameter of when to interact with,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.87,
          "end": 46.203,
          "en": "and the value I want to apply for this parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.04,
          "end": 50.61,
          "en": "The parameter is always referenced to with double dashes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.61,
          "end": 52.56,
          "en": "Here on the Mac, these double dashes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.56,
          "end": 55.59,
          "en": "are converted to a longer single dash.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.59,
          "end": 58.14,
          "en": "Both the double dashes and this converted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.14,
          "end": 60.81,
          "en": "longer dash are recognized by Midjourney,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.81,
          "end": 62.43,
          "en": "so that's not a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.43,
          "end": 65.49,
          "en": "And after the definition of the parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.49,
          "end": 68.22,
          "en": "we add the value that should be applied.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.22,
          "end": 69.57,
          "en": "Here in the first case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.57,
          "end": 74.19,
          "en": "I wanna change the aspect ratio to 16.9.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.19,
          "end": 75.023,
          "en": "As you can see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.023,
          "end": 78.78,
          "en": "you can also add multiple parameters to a prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.78,
          "end": 82.11,
          "en": "So the second parameter here is the style parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.11,
          "end": 85.02,
          "en": "which is set to a value of raw.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.02,
          "end": 87.69,
          "en": "As I'm using Midjourney 5.1,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.69,
          "end": 90.53999999999999,
          "en": "adding this parameter to my prompt means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.53999999999999,
          "end": 93.36,
          "en": "that for this specific image generation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.36,
          "end": 97.56,
          "en": "I want to use the raw version of Midjourney 5.1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.56,
          "end": 100.14,
          "en": "This only works for this specific prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.14,
          "end": 103.22999999999999,
          "en": "So instead of changing the actual settings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.22999999999999,
          "end": 106.8,
          "en": "to apply the raw version to all images generated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.8,
          "end": 109.05,
          "en": "we can use this parameter, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.05,
          "end": 112.86,
          "en": "to only change the creation of an individual image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.86,
          "end": 115.44,
          "en": "There are plenty of parameters available,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.44,
          "end": 117.12,
          "en": "and you can find all of these",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.12,
          "end": 119.49000000000001,
          "en": "in the official Midjourney docs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 119.49000000000001,
          "end": 121.59,
          "en": "I won't dive into all of these now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.59,
          "end": 124.29,
          "en": "as I just want to show you some basic examples",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.29,
          "end": 127.05,
          "en": "to understand how parameters work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 127.05,
          "end": 128.67,
          "en": "You can then dive deeper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.67,
          "end": 131.49,
          "en": "into these on your own if you want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 131.49,
          "end": 133.11,
          "en": "Parameters are not required",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.11,
          "end": 135.12,
          "en": "to get started with Midjourney though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.12,
          "end": 137.57999999999998,
          "en": "but things like the aspect ratio, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 137.57999999999998,
          "end": 139.29,
          "en": "is quite nice to know,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 139.29,
          "end": 142.29,
          "en": "because typically you wanna have images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 142.29,
          "end": 145.143,
          "en": "with a specific aspect ratio applied.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ],
      "lectureOrder": 183,
      "videoOrder": 183
    }
  ],
